    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "Dear friends, you may wonder why I write so little. It's because I rarely use my laptop. At least you can see where I am and look at some photos. If you want to ask me something, communicate with a direct message. Internet access can be limited, but none-the-less, I do have plenty of opportunity to work offline.\n\nStudents can send text editing projects, and I need someone to help edit my website and many other editing projects.",
